words": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ulVaROEh2yQQ7kNvwGTAgoa&_nc_oc=Adk4lcmhGtyG0jNTPGi5248PXyiHKYAaQJ2Jh37F6xyvTEzs-ZSazAFTIriTgiTdbZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfujIek3d7cCh1HiNa3hctg7o_91YFTcAqb030CiqjCmwQ&oe=69A832C1"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=es2JeLrEdWsQ7kNvwE89MSz&_nc_oc=Admb1F0ExskBp1SeziA7rljQQLWMHgqJ78FM8pLK9jYTl1OhsTIbDmIy2wN1tnioIXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afv4Qsl9VEm9TGEco5LQCzSQpj20SmcPVQj3OoLfReKF4w&oe=69A82733"}, {"file_name": "Cover-Square.png", "id": "811623013181900", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974629_811623016515233_3126397619395326849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2fBs8JAiYxYQ7kNvwFI7Jhp&_nc_oc=AdlCcO-uE33a1--wq-PWdwVeYuifZD0AYmR-xOIhtWS8PyPqwt9xmd9r